  "prefLabel": "Env-A 402.02 Maximum Total Emissions for Class B Major Sources",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 402.02 Maximum Total Emissions for Class B Major Sources. Pursuant to RSA 125-D:3, I(c), for each running 4-year period the combined SO2 emissions from all class B major sources shall not exceed 75 percent of their combined baseline SO2 emissions.\n\nSource. #10288, eff 3-19-13; ss by #13641, eff 5-23-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a400.html"
